 ploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
UID:_YwD08T57_8gw9fqwAcfB
SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - October 20
	26
DTSTAMP:20260813T043111Z
DTSTART:20261003T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually the first 
	Saturday of every month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exa
	ct dates. \nPLEASE NOTE: Attendees must register by 8:00 AM the Friday bef
	ore each bike ride. Contact Michaela for more information. \nWant to make 
	an even bigger impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist
	 with equipment\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an e
	xperienced cyclist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensur
	e a safe\, fun\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more
	 details or to volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@ho
	ustonlighthouse.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website.
	 \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-wit
	h-achilles-international-october-2026/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-october-2026/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
